        // Establish a nonzero debt for the caller before the deciding call.
        // The caller here is address(this), and mintSynth is onlyPool, so it will revert
        // unless the caller is a curated pool. If the setup call reverts, the rule below
        // must still hold for the actual burnSynth outcome.
        bool setupSucceeded;
