        require(recipient != address(0), "recipient");

        // Set allowance: sender must be msg.sender for approve. We cannot.
        // So we drive through this contract's own allowance using transferFrom where
        // sender = address(this). First mint some balance to this contract via mintSynth?
        // mintSynth is onlyPool. Not available. So we test the revert condition.

        // Simpler general rule: transferFrom reverts if the caller has no allowance and sender has no balance.
        // We set allowanceAmount and see if it controls revert when balance is insufficient.
        // Approve from this contract to itself is not meaningful for transferFrom(sender=this).
        // Use sender = address(this) and spender = address(this).
